    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110503" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φελλεύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stony ground,</i>
